      <p class="viz-note">Hover any pixel on the grid. The matching coordinate in the vector highlights. The image isn't a picture anymore. It's a point in 784-dimensional space. Two different digits become two different points. Two <em>similar</em> digits become two <em>nearby</em> points. Structure gets smuggled in for free, just by laying pixels out in a row.</p>
